      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I like this Idea and want to add to this.\nThe game can have this slot based on the player's Minimum Displayed performants Rank.\nSo if someone is in a Verypoor avatar But your Rank is set to Medium.\nIt will show you what ever avatar they have set to there fallback slot.\nhere is a idea for the UI. (this is bad but it gets the idea across)\nthe only problem I can see with this is avatar scale and Final IK\nWith that said they did it with quest so dont see any problem on the scale and final IK part.",
